# Webtop build needs the full Flutter project including path-dep packages.
# Whitelist every frontend the launcher (or its shell adapters) statically
# depend on at build time, so `flutter pub get` can resolve path deps.
# NOTE: `!dir/` re-includes everything under it, overriding the generic
# `build/`/`.dart_tool/` excludes above for these specific paths -- re-exclude
# each whitelisted frontend's own build output explicitly below, or local
# Flutter build artifacts (multi-GB debug APKs, gradle caches) get shipped
# into every image's build context and can exhaust the Docker VM's disk.
!Neurobench/frontend/
!neurocnl/frontend/
!Neurosim/frontend/
!Neurochip/frontend/
!Neurohub/frontend/
Neurobench/frontend/build/
Neurobench/frontend/.dart_tool/
neurocnl/frontend/build/
neurocnl/frontend/.dart_tool/
Neurosim/frontend/build/
Neurosim/frontend/.dart_tool/
Neurochip/frontend/build/
Neurochip/frontend/.dart_tool/
Neurohub/frontend/build/
Neurohub/frontend/.dart_tool/

# Test and demo data
data/
Neuro-Dream-Hand/
ai_safe/
issues/
issues-archive/
docs/
monitoring/

# Tool caches / editor state (not needed by any Dockerfile)
.cache/
.hypothesis/
.kiro/
.understand-anything/
.sisyphus/
.impeccable/
.tmp_manual_ui/

# Prevent massive context uploads
scripts/data/
paper/
codeflow-report.json
nmtk/neuro_toolkit/build/
nmtk/neuro_toolkit/.dart_tool/
nmtk_ui_core/build/
nmtk_ui_core/.dart_tool/

# Tool caches, at every depth. Docker matches each pattern against the whole
# relative path, so a bare `.mypy_cache` covers only the repo root -- the ones
# inside modules (neurocnl, Neurochip, Neurobench, Neurohub, neurocli ...) were
# still being uploaded, ~850 MB into every image's context, which is enough on
# its own to fill the Docker VM disk and fail the build with "no space left on
# device". These come last so they also win over the `!module/frontend/`
# re-includes above.
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/__pycache__/
**/.hypothesis/
**/*.pyc
**/*.egg-info
**/.venv/
**/venv/
**/*.log
